670: ## Investigation Brief 05
671: — Meeting Amendments and Owners
672: 
673: Committee minutes show owner churn from unsigned drafts. Ledger owner is the
674: default. Meeting note amendments under `#### Amendment for TXN-<uuid>` replace
675: owner when `signed: true` (case insensitive) and, when the amendment includes
676: `effective: YYYY-MM-DD`, only if that date is greater than or equal to the
677: ledger date for the transaction.
